# HUVEC 成管实验

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-huvec
schema: 1
title: HUVEC 成管实验
objective: 比较 3%、5%、7% GelMA 水凝胶对 HUVEC 成管的影响
research_question: 不同 GelMA 浓度是否改变 HUVEC 成管能力？
experimental_unit: 一个 12 孔板孔
factors:
  - name: GelMA 浓度
    levels: ["3%", "5%", "7%"]
timepoints: [6 h, 12 h, 24 h]
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: group-3pct
schema: 1
name: 3% GelMA
role: treatment
condition: 3% GelMA
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: group-5pct
schema: 1
name: 5% GelMA
role: treatment
condition: 5% GelMA
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: group-7pct
schema: 1
name: 7% GelMA
role: treatment
condition: 7% GelMA
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-tube
schema: 1
title: HUVEC 成管
endpoint: tube length
method: 光镜成像
unit: µm
group_refs: [group-3pct, group-5pct, group-7pct]
timepoints: [6 h, 12 h, 24 h]
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-gel
schema: 1
title: GelMA 消毒与脱泡
assay: assay-tube
timepoints: []
path: ""
tasks:
  - id: task-gel
    title: 80℃ 5min / 冰上 10min，重复三次；2000rpm 脱泡
    kind: procedure
checks:
  - checkId: bubbles
    title: 确认无明显气泡
    blocking: true
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-cast
schema: 1
title: 铺胶与 UV 固化
assay: assay-tube
timepoints: []
path: ""
tasks:
  - id: task-cast
    title: 12 孔板每孔铺 0.5ml 水凝胶，UV 固化 120s
    kind: procedure
checks:
  - checkId: uv
    title: 确认 UV 120s
    blocking: true
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-seed
schema: 1
title: 接种 HUVEC
assay: assay-tube
timepoints: [6 h, 12 h, 24 h]
path: ""
tasks:
  - id: task-seed
    title: 每孔 0.5ml 细胞悬液，1×10^5/孔，提前加入 VEGF
    kind: procedure
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-huvec
schema: 1
steps: [step-gel, step-cast, step-seed]
edges:
  - from: step-gel
    to: step-cast
  - from: step-cast
    to: step-seed
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-huvec
schema: 1
format: 12
assay: assay-tube
timepoint: 6 h
groups:
  group-3pct: [A1, A2, A3, A4]
  group-5pct: [B1, B2, B3, B4]
  group-7pct: [C1, C2, C3, C4]
```
